{
	"name": "Dramatic Persona",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/social/wave-halt-stop.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By telling grand tales of your escapades, and those of your allies, you are able to use your flair for the dramatic to improve your social standing. If you spend 1 minute or more telling at least one story of your deeds, you gain expertise on persuasion, deception, or intimidation checks among those who heard the tale for the next hour, chosen when you tell the story. Alternatively, if you spend at least an hour telling tales, you may expend 1 exertion point to treat the community you are in as your prestige center for 1 week.</p>",
